{"id": 261, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">Hair transplantation moves healthy hair follicles from areas where hair is resistant to thinning, usually the back and sides of the head, to areas with thinning or hair loss. It is one of the most requested aesthetic procedures for men and women with pattern hair loss, and the results grow naturally with your own hair.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":760,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-transplant-planning.jpg\" alt=\"Hair transplant planning with the treatment area marked on the scalp\" class=\"wp-image-760\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair transplantation treatments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":763,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-scalp-examination.jpg\" alt=\"Scalp examined for thinning hair\" class=\"wp-image-763\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair and Scalp Analysis</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before any treatment, an AI-supported digital analysis evaluates hair density and thickness, the health of individual follicles and whether they are in a growth or resting phase. This helps to choose the most suitable technique and to track your progress objectively over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":752,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-thinning-1024x684.jpg\" alt=\"Man checking his thinning hair\" class=\"wp-image-752\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FUE (Follicular Unit Extraction)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Individual follicles are taken one by one from the donor area with a fine, circular micro-punch and implanted into the thinning areas. No linear scar, and a comfortable recovery.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":753,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-beard-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Man with a full, well-groomed beard\" class=\"wp-image-753\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Beard and Moustache Transplant</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For a fuller, more defined beard or moustache. Follicles, usually from the back of the head, are transplanted into sparse areas. An effective option for uneven growth, scarring or hair loss caused by genetics, hormones or injury.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":754,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-eyebrows-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Close-up of full, natural eyebrows\" class=\"wp-image-754\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Eyebrow Transplant</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reshapes and strengthens thin, sparse or over-plucked eyebrows with your own hair follicles. A permanent, natural-looking alternative to make-up or microblading.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":973,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261a.jpg\" alt=\"Hair transplant procedure in a clinic\" class=\"wp-image-973\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sapphire FUE</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An advanced form of FUE in which the channels are opened with blades made of sapphire crystal instead of steel. The finer, sharper blades allow very precise incisions, with less tissue trauma and swelling.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":976,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261b.jpg\" alt=\"Doctor reviewing treatment notes on a tablet\" class=\"wp-image-976\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">DHI (Direct Hair Implantation)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Follicles are implanted directly with a special implanter pen (Choi pen), without opening channels in advance. This allows precise control of angle, direction and depth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":977,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261c.jpg\" alt=\"Thinning hair on the back of the head\" class=\"wp-image-977\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FUT (Follicular Unit Transplantation)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A strip of skin is taken from the donor area and divided into individual follicular units. FUT allows many grafts in one session but leaves a longer linear scar, so it is used today only in selected cases.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Restorative Hair Therapies</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not every case of thinning hair needs surgery. Restorative hair therapies nourish and stimulate the hair follicles, help to slow hair loss and improve hair density and quality. They can be used on their own or to support the results of a hair transplant.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":764,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-scalp-therapy.jpg\" alt=\"Scalp treatment for hair revitalisation in a clinic\" class=\"wp-image-764\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Exosome Therapy</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Exosomes are tiny vesicles released by cells that carry proteins, lipids and growth signals. For hair restoration they are usually derived from mesenchymal stem cells and injected into thinning areas of the scalp, where they stimulate the follicles, extend the growth phase and support a healthier scalp. Exosomes are often combined with PRP.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":755,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-hair-scalp-mesotherapy-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"Mesotherapy injection into the scalp for hair revitalisation\" class=\"wp-image-755\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair Mesotherapy</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A tailored blend of vitamins, amino acids, plant extracts and other active ingredients is injected into the scalp to nourish the hair follicles. Usually performed as a series of sessions; many patients notice thicker, stronger hair over time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A motorised mesotherapy device delivers even micro-injections at a controlled depth, which makes the treatment quicker and more comfortable than manual injections.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":979,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261d.jpg\" alt=\"Red light device used during a skin treatment\" class=\"wp-image-979\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Red Light Therapy</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A non-invasive, low-level light treatment at wavelengths of around 600 to 650 nanometres. The light is absorbed by the follicle cells, stimulates their energy production, improves local circulation and supports healthy hair growth.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":978,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c261e.jpg\" alt=\"Syringe prepared for a treatment\" class=\"wp-image-978\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">PRP (Platelet-Rich Plasma)</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A small amount of your own blood is processed in a centrifuge to obtain plasma rich in platelets. Injected into the scalp, it stimulates the hair follicles and supports cell renewal. PRP is a well-established option to reduce hair loss and improve hair density.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your hair treatment with confidence</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"}}